Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.48,0:00:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,My...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.39,0:00:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,my strength, it's... it's gone. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.60,0:00:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't lift...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.46,0:00:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Miseria.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.46,0:00:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Even my vision's blurry. Dammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.98,0:00:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.08,0:00:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew this moment would come.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.22,0:00:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But why now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.50,0:00:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I must press on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.70,0:00:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What did...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.68,0:00:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.62,0:00:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati and his crew are\Ntrying to get somewhere right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.10,0:00:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This could be my chance to learn where.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.74,0:00:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the boss is desperate to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.98,0:00:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, uh, looks like you could use a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.58,0:00:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, I'm happy to\Nassist you if you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.28,0:00:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You again?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.42,0:00:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.18,0:00:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.58,0:00:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You should get to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.96,0:00:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.87,0:00:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to seem pushy or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.86,0:00:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to make sure\Nyou get across safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.10,0:00:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It would put me at ease\Nif you let me help.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.80,0:01:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, um, only if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.40,0:01:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,On second thought, I suppose\NI could use a touch of help.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.24,0:01:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we heading, good sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.10,0:01:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Not too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.32,0:01:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Just the entrance to the Coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.74,0:01:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's where you're trying to get to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.52,0:02:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.43,0:02:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.62,0:02:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.82,0:02:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't care, don't care\NYou hear it, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.60,0:02:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear it, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.51,0:02:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,When your body dies,\NI'll be here to help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.40,0:02:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.68,0:02:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the beginning of the doorbell ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.62,0:02:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.50,0:03:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.92,0:03:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta look both ways\Nwhen you're cr - Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.78,0:03:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.74,0:03:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,His hands are so cold and clammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.60,0:03:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.26,0:03:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing I just tripped on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.48,0:03:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it a guardrail?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.62,0:03:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.58,0:03:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this mean he can't see anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.94,0:03:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And he didn't even flinch when\Nthat driver honked his horn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.62,0:03:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Are his ears busted too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.10,0:03:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That gas you have on your throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.26,0:03:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.17,0:03:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I do that to you\Nin the scuffle earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.36,0:03:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's probably not the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.90,0:03:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The wound has already stopped bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.86,0:03:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That means it's older.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.84,0:03:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you manage to hurt yourself there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.02,0:03:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He's staring right at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.46,0:03:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So he can't still see?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.40,0:03:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, but it's hidden under my collar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.52,0:03:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Or the injury I got from fighting Risotto.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.10,0:04:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How kind of you to help me pick that\Nup. Crazy mille. I'll take that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.22,0:04:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.10,0:04:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.12,0:04:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So he can hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.98,0:04:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, whatever's ailing him seems way\Nmore complex than just battle wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.14,0:04:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What's making him act like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.40,0:04:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.52,0:04:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Guido Mista. Figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.62,0:04:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew things were going too well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.56,0:04:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Should have guessed his friends\Nwouldn't be too far behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.60,0:04:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.51,0:04:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.43,0:04:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We've yet to finish crossing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.94,0:04:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.58,0:04:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.08,0:04:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,My wound opened up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.30,0:04:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just be a minute, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.04,0:04:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap, crap, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.30,0:04:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.62,0:04:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse my bluntness,\Nbut I need to get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.52,0:04:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for all the help\Nyou've given me so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.32,0:04:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.24,0:04:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to stay here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.82,0:05:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, there's another car coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.44,0:05:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We can keep crossing once it passes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.24,0:05:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.15,0:05:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We've already cleared\Nthat side of the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.82,0:05:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It should be safe to continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.52,0:05:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, the clock's ticking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.02,0:05:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! No! Mista's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.66,0:05:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just have to kill\Nhim! Right here! Right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.76,0:05:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my goodness, I wonder what\Nthat noise could have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.94,0:05:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,For God's sake, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.80,0:05:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What perplexing game are you playing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.76,0:05:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you have to call now of all times?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.10,0:05:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want him to find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.06,0:05:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.78,0:05:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you quit blowing me up, dude?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.98,0:05:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so damn important, you\Ngotta tell me right this second.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.36,0:05:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna blow my freaking cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.42,0:05:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Trish, get back inside the turtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.82,0:05:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not out of the woods yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.78,0:06:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Please keep a low head for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.76,0:06:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.67,0:06:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.62,0:06:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I can sense him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.20,0:06:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He's here, I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.02,0:06:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That horrible feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.08,0:06:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no mistaking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.36,0:06:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the same one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.82,0:06:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.02,0:06:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.86,0:06:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally recognize you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.26,0:06:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.36,0:06:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Trish!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.28,0:06:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel it. He's nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.66,0:06:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss is closing in on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.82,0:06:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me which way to shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.28,0:06:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you tell us exactly where he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.02,0:06:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He suddenly appeared, but\NI can't pinpoint where.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.42,0:06:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.42,0:06:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank the heavens above.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.48,0:06:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.92,0:06:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You've achieved an incredible feat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.94,0:06:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,although I expect nothing\Nshort of perfection from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.48,0:06:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.78,0:06:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Bujarati's eyes may\Nseem to be fixed on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.50,0:06:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,but he does not truly see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.40,0:06:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.66,0:07:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.16,0:07:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I possess no insight as to how,\Nbut he's now a reanimated corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.58,0:07:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He lacks both a pulse and a\Nworking respiratory system.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.68,0:07:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He's lost use of his eyes, and his eardrums\Nwere ruptured in his fight with Seko.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.74,0:07:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing he's able to see,\NDeep, is a rough outline of your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.46,0:07:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The only sound he can\Nhear are its vibrations.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.00,0:07:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Physical objects are now invisible to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.78,0:07:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,He sees not the car, but the\Nessence of the driver within.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.58,0:07:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Trish, talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.00,0:07:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something happen to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.56,0:07:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It just so happens my daughter\Nand I am at near-identical auras.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.82,0:07:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And for the moment, I\Nhave cloaked you in mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.82,0:07:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati presently believes\Nhe is looking at Trish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.86,0:07:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You must maintain this illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.86,0:07:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him be your personal guide and have\Nhim take you to this secret meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.82,0:07:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Trish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.28,0:07:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.62,0:07:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I got a little lightheaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.38,0:07:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.70,0:07:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm relieved to see you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.88,0:08:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.48,0:08:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, have you seen\Na young man anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.48,0:08:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.56,0:08:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He looked kind of flustered\Nand left in a big hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.48,0:08:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't worry about him, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.52,0:08:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, we need to\Nstay focused on moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.86,0:08:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.16,0:08:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but could...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.02,0:08:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you give me a little hand, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.90,0:08:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.20,0:08:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be glad to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.24,0:08:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,In the outskirts of Napoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.22,0:08:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.13,0:08:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a house.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.28,0:08:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't big, but when this is all over,\Nby chance you find yourself needing a home,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.42,0:08:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be more than welcome there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.00,0:08:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, the area's pretty nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.68,0:08:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Good eats and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.90,0:08:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's close to the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.30,0:09:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I know this has all\Nbeen one big nightmare,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.86,0:09:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,but I promise a much\Nbrighter future is waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.32,0:09:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds nice, but let's stay focused.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.26,0:09:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Which way do you want me to steer us next?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.30,0:09:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The stairs, please, if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.70,0:09:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean these?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.68,0:09:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not turn around, Dobio!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.56,0:09:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.08,0:09:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Continue onward as if nothing happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.32,0:09:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.80,0:09:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Behind the stone pillars above,\Nsomeone is watching your every move.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.40,0:09:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So, he really is here to\Nrendezvous with our foes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.00,0:09:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But who could they be?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.62,0:09:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I've zero intel on this person.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.88,0:09:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you so sure that\Nthey're really here, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.94,0:09:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, even if you're right,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.58,0:09:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,how am I supposed to figure out who\Nthey are if I can't turn around?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.02,0:09:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Look into Butorati's eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.92,0:09:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They will tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.98,0:09:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, while the reflection's there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.56,0:09:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.66,0:09:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay right where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.60,0:09:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Get a step closer to those stairs,\Nand our agreement will be nullified.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.82,0:09:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You were right. Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.36,0:10:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's hiding out behind the pillar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.12,0:10:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.14,0:10:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Bruno Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.54,0:10:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come here on your promise\Nto reveal the boss's weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.80,0:10:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you mean to keep your word.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.70,0:10:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.00,0:10:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The problem's your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.48,0:10:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I never said you could bring a plus one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.66,0:10:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't find a shred of\Ndata on them in my records.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.68,0:10:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course you wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.16,0:10:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Trish here isn't a member of the Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.30,0:10:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, we met barely\Nmore than a few days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.66,0:10:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But as you can clearly\Nsee, she's batting for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.80,0:10:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Trish, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.98,0:10:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,To my knowledge, that's a woman's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.50,0:10:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Your point?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.02,0:10:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Merida, I think the jig's\Nup, boss. Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.50,0:10:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, you must respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.76,0:10:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Act furious at him for\Ndoubting your femininity.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.48,0:10:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it, Deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.86,0:10:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You got some kind of problem\Nwith me being a girl, you pig?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.80,0:10:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My deepest apologies, mademoiselle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.10,0:10:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see very well in this light.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.34,0:10:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the lady a stand user?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.34,0:11:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.94,0:11:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now down to business.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.24,0:11:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's about time\Nyou tell us who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.58,0:11:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's talk about why you dragged me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.72,0:11:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.63,0:11:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see her stand first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.18,0:11:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And Trish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.24,0:11:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No sudden movements.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.72,0:11:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no data on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.62,0:11:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But show me your stand and I'll get\Nover it. Shit! What now? Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.70,0:11:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears we're dealing\Nwith a seasoned gladiator.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.78,0:11:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He's even trying to gauge\Na potential enemy's range.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.30,0:11:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is this man?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.96,0:11:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How have I never heard of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.44,0:11:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.74,0:11:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't be too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.36,0:11:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of it like lifting up\Nyour skirt nice and slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.72,0:11:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's... But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.22,0:11:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How does he possess that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.50,0:11:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That arrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.62,0:11:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.98,0:11:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the same artifact.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.62,0:11:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And that bloodlust, it's overwhelming.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.70,0:11:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It almost feels like a\Ndagger racing for my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.70,0:11:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Where have I felt this before?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.08,0:11:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mon Dieu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.80,0:11:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.94,0:12:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I have crossed paths with this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.46,0:12:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He utilized the arrow to\Ntrack me down back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.10,0:12:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.58,0:12:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,In Egypt, I unearthed a scattering of\Narrows was capable of awakening stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.10,0:12:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew simply from beholding them, they\Npossessed a certain entrancing energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.56,0:12:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,An old woman by the name of\NNyaba, who had two right hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.62,0:12:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,asked that I sell her some in\Nexchange for their secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.52,0:12:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,In truth, I only needed one, so I sold her\Nthe other five for a very generous sum.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.62,0:12:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That is when the old bag uttered\Nsomething I found truly bizarre.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.10,0:12:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The arrow chooses people, and those\Nchosen are bound by a curious force.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.50,0:12:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The 20th century was in its final\Ndecade, and Dio had passed. At the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.50,0:12:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,my old friend Jotaro Kujo and I were
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.46,0:12:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,investigating the arrow\Nwhich could awaken Stans.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.64,0:13:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Word had reached us of a young\Nboy who had pilfered them
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.06,0:13:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,so he split up and scoured\Nthe globe for the bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.98,0:13:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro would search America and Asia,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.92,0:13:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And I, Europe and Africa, I soon managed\Nto learn the arrow was somewhere in Italy,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.46,0:13:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,hidden in a region suddenly\Novercome by drug-related crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.96,0:13:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I focused my search on\Na specific region where
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.14,0:13:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,juvenile drug deaths had\Nseen an unusual jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.56,0:13:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's when I knew we were getting close.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.80,0:13:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.12,0:13:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,In a few years, my syndicate\Nwas on the cusp of perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.52,0:13:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,My Family swore allegiance to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.16,0:13:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I had men in every crevice of society.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.56,0:13:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I discovered that someone was\Nplotting to unveil my identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.00,0:13:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, I'd finish them off myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.28,0:14:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.24,0:14:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd made my decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.44,0:14:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ultimately I committed two fatal errors.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.36,0:14:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,First was my failure to recognize this
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.66,0:14:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,syndicate had already\Nmatured to full strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.66,0:14:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Communications, the government, the\Npress, society had me completely isolated.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.84,0:14:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Then came my second and grievous mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.82,0:14:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Silver chariot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.50,0:14:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you're about to die,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.30,0:14:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I might as well tell you\Nthe man who would unearth
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.36,0:14:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,those arrows he possessed\Na power many times more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.44,0:14:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,than I could ever imagine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.50,0:14:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Long before your gaze\Ncan hope to reach me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.82,0:14:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,His ability breaks time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.42,0:14:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have already left this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.96,0:14:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Has hope...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.32,0:14:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Perished from the Earth, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.52,0:15:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I was certain I'd finish the job,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.22,0:15:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,to think one of them\Nwould return from death,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.68,0:15:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and with the arrow in\Ntheir grasp, no less.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.70,0:15:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati, that man's no friend of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.24,0:15:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.50,0:15:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati, that bastard,\Nwhere'd he run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.02,0:15:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.94,0:15:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Putan, where did he go? That little\Nuninvited guest of yours, where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.42,0:15:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Datrice...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.33,0:15:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me, dammit, where the hell\Nis that swine you brought with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.24,0:15:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing seemed to fall, but somehow\Nthe broken piece found its way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.92,0:15:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It couldn't be these movements.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.06,0:15:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.14,0:15:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to skip forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.48,0:15:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like what happened in Venice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.18,0:15:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We climbed the stairs\Nbefore we realized it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.94,0:16:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.30,0:16:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's already there. The boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.44,0:16:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got our guy within his range!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.82,0:16:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm being tested.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.34,0:16:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,In a moment, we will find out if\NI'm prepared to vanquish my past.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.96,0:16:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We really only grow once we've conquered\Nour phantoms, wouldn't you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.52,0:16:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How lovely to see you again,\NJean-Pierre Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.54,0:16:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.66,0:16:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Diavolo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.44,0:17:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Fascinating how the past\Ncan wriggle its way back,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.56,0:17:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter how many pieces\NI might cut it up into.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.26,0:17:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You amaze me, I never thought I'd deal\Nwith the same vermin more than once.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.60,0:17:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you slither up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.10,0:17:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me be perfectly clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.78,0:17:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't care less\Nabout how you managed to
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.28,0:17:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,live after I slung you\Nlike chum into the abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.72,0:17:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What interests me, Polnareff,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.98,0:17:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,is whatever little secret you were all so
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.02,0:17:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Eager to share with\NBucciarati and his men!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.20,0:17:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Walk up those steps and\Nsee what happens, asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.92,0:17:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I have the high ground while\Nyou're stuck way down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.70,0:17:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you shrink from battling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.82,0:17:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I scare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.52,0:17:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Has your spirit lost some of its vigor?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.98,0:17:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Or has your body now given in to time?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.72,0:17:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you plotting with the arrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.24,0:17:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.88,0:17:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it was a kid I saw down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.70,0:17:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Malodorous wretch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.04,0:17:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you get so close to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.50,0:17:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The high ground is mine! En Card!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.16,0:17:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Say your goodbyes to that arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.96,0:17:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I've sent you back to the depths of\Nhell, you'll have no further need for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.30,0:18:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.21,0:18:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Silver Terunosu!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.52,0:18:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Still sharp as ever, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.66,0:18:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You in that stand of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.34,0:18:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems you've learned a new trick, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.96,0:18:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're trying to pinpoint\Nthe moments I skip
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.10,0:18:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,through time by keeping\Ncount of the blood drops.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.74,0:18:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Resourceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.65,0:18:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,A moment's difference reveals so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.18,0:18:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Your grasp of time is masterful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.60,0:18:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Had I gone just a little bit closer, you\Nmight have dealt a consequential blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.32,0:18:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.12,0:18:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How did Diablo reach the\NColosseum before the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.56,0:18:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.20,0:18:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's now or never.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.74,0:18:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it takes, I have to\Nkeep the flames of hope alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.50,0:18:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You died the second you were in range.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.00,0:18:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll I'll make sure you stay\Nthat way, Emperor Crimson!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.70,0:19:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,When the sands of time resume,\Nyou'll no longer be able to look?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.56,0:19:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,at your precious blood drops for guidance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.96,0:19:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A cursed mistake from my past.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.12,0:19:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold, I shall obliterate you now! Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.86,0:19:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy the fatal relief that time will...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.68,0:19:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.08,0:19:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The arrow! The stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.24,0:19:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This nonsense will cease! Perish!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.18,0:19:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This radiance!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.86,0:19:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening to Silver Chariot?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.94,0:19:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Such sheer power!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.44,0:19:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The arrow's bursting with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.14,0:19:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This ends now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.24,0:19:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Time resume your flow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.62,0:19:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,French rat, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.66,0:19:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't tell me, is the arrow able to do\Nmore than draw out the power of a stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.86,0:19:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a long shot, but there's no other\Nway of keeping the arrow from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.06,0:19:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It pains me that I had to show him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.20,0:19:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I can no longer deny I've lost\Nthe strength to fully control the arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.44,0:20:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't run!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.28,0:20:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The arrow is hope-given form.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.00,0:20:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Whosoever comes to control it will\Nbe able to control the world as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.24,0:20:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.15,0:20:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It just happened again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.84,0:20:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.88,0:20:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a blip in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.66,0:20:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Trish, where'd you sense the boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.22,0:20:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,All those wasted years trying to\Nuncover the mystery of the arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.58,0:20:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you made it this long.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.50,0:20:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What an utter travesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.62,0:20:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The arrow is mine, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.10,0:21:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Your valiant heart has\Nstopped beating at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.42,0:21:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If it offers you any solace, know\Nthat you did not die in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.20,0:21:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, dear Jean-Bierre Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.88,0:21:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done me a greater service\Nthan you'll ever realize.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.02,0:21:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I tell you that sincerely.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.56,0:21:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.80,0:21:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I found Bucciarati! He's\Nright there! Come on! Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.48,0:21:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor guy got pummeled hard!\NBucciarati! Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.94,0:21:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss is lurking somewhere near!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.14,0:21:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You've come.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.66,0:21:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.82,0:21:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop now! Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.44,0:21:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Identify yourself immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.66,0:22:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What is just fiction or what is the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.48,0:22:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They have a mission, they have a passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.60,0:22:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But they dare to tell us\Nwhat's bad and what's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.84,0:22:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up, join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.32,0:22:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, I'll say this a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.96,0:22:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We are the power, who'll be the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.36,0:22:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we are the fighters,\Njust fighting for
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.87,0:24:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.79,0:24:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,you.
